  "description": "Catch the summer wave and bring energetic street-art vibes to your projects with Summer Graffiti, a fun, bold, and quirky summer display font! Combining playful paper-cut shapes with fresh urban graffiti styling, this font brings a vibrant, cheerful, and sun-soaked look to all your seasonal designs.\nEngineered with smooth, clean cutlines, Summer Graffiti is 100% craft-friendly and ideal for Cricut, Silhouette, laser cutting, vinyl decals, and print-on-demand products. Whether you are creating summer party invitations, beach wear, tropical quotes, stickers, or pool party banners, this font will make your artwork pop with sunshine and energy!",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Catch the summer wave and bring energetic street-art vibes to your projects with Summer Graffiti, a fun, bold, and quirky summer display font! Combining playful paper-cut shapes with fresh urban graffiti styling, this font brings a vibrant, cheerful, and sun-soaked look to all your seasonal designs.</p>\n<p>Engineered with smooth, clean cutlines, Summer Graffiti is 100% craft-friendly and ideal for Cricut, Silhouette, laser cutting, vinyl decals, and print-on-demand products. Whether you are creating summer party invitations, beach wear, tropical quotes, stickers, or pool party banners, this font will make your artwork pop with sunshine and energy!</p>",
